<title>PORTUGAL: Suspension lifted in Lisnave shares.</title>
<headline>Suspension lifted in Lisnave shares.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Financial Markets Committee (CMVM) lifted a suspension of trade in shares of Portuguese ship repairer Lisnave, dealers said.</p>
<p>CMVM officials were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The CMVM suspended the stock on Wednesday after the bourse interrupted trade to seek more information about the company's restructuring.</p>
</text>
